{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The memory cards fit my repeated purchases of storage for cameras and other devices, so a compatible spare or larger card feels useful.",
    "The SanDisk SDHC card connects naturally to my photography accessories; the 64GB bundle also interests me for its storage, though I already have a reader."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "My photography purchases do not mean I need a home-monitoring camera; the WYZE Cam serves a different purpose from my tripods and lens accessories.",
    "Streaming sticks, a voice assistant, and a smart plug do not solve a need I have identified. Likewise, buying cables before does not mean I currently need a ten-foot HDMI cable or a Wi-Fi extender."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Owning a Fire tablet seems to have been taken as interest in more Amazon devices, although my related purchases were practical accessories for that tablet.",
    "My purchases of electronics and power accessories seem to have been read as broad interest in connected-home products, rather than purchases for specific tasks."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "Memory cards, card cases, tripods, and a lens cap recur in my history, making photography and storage supplies more relevant to me than a new streaming setup.",
    "Compatibility and what I already own matter: an SD card and a microSD card are not interchangeable for every device, and another reader adds less value because I bought the UGREEN reader."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my storage needs but stretched my device purchases into interest in streaming and home automation without a clear reason."
}"}
